    "description": {
      "value": "A repair kit allows you to perform simple repairs while traveling. It contains a portable anvil, tongs, woodworking tools, a whetstone, and oils for conditioning leather and wood. You can use a repair kit to Repair items using the Crafting skill. You can draw and replace a worn repair kit as part of the action that uses it.\n\nA superb repair kit gives you a +1 item bonus to the check."
